WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.075
A triangle is half of a parallelogram.

2
00:00:03.775 --> 00:00:06.600
Add a copy of the triangle, turned round.

3
00:00:10.018 --> 00:00:13.968
Together they make a parallelogram. The triangle is half of it.

4
00:00:16.113 --> 00:00:19.263
Move the top along. The area stays the same.
